{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/507980-professional-training","id":507980,"title":"Professional Training","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-08T06:45:17-07:00","id":507980,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Professional Training","content":"Hello! I know that this has been a question many times over. I have sifted through several posts regarding this merit, but I wasnt able to find a definitive answer. There were a lot of &quot;I thinks&quot; and &quot;this is what I would do&quot;. I am aware that vampires can't use it for disciplines unless they are a &quot;Professional Vampire&quot; which I dont think is a thing? Anyway. If I was human with Pyrokenesis can i use my Professional Training (Occultist) with that merit to get 9 agains on my rolls. I am aware that I need to spend a will power to use the merit as is so I wouldnt be able to spend the will power to make it rote, buuuut If I could spend 2 per turn, would I be able to do that too?<br /> <br /> More or less I am asking can Professional Training be used with Supernatural Merits? Thank you!<br /> <br /> <br /> I was able to find that you can use it with Fighting style merits because they are &quot;mundane&quot; rolls. I just want to confirm that is correct?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T09:35:44-07:00","id":508162,"title":"","content":"I don't think there's an official ruling on this.<br /> <br /> So the basic answer you're going to get besides opinions is: What your ST feels is right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T09:52:50-07:00","id":508171,"title":"","content":"Most ST I have heard will rule that it will work on mundane actions. A human occultist with supernatural merits may be an exception but it is only because it isn't a wide sudden power jump,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T11:03:42-07:00","id":508204,"title":"","content":"There really is no official answer, so all you're going to get is &quot;I think&quot;s and &quot;this is what I would do&quot;s. I only allow Professional Training to apply to mundane tasks. No powers, no supernatural Merits, just plain old-fashioned Attribute + Skill rolls. Your ST may feel differently, you should ask them. If you're the ST, rule how ever you feel suits your game best.<br /> <br /> Also, as the person who posted the &quot;professional vampire&quot; comment you referred to, I meant it to be tongue-in-cheek. So no, professional vampire is not a thing, at least not in my games. That said, there's no real reason it couldn't be (other than the fact that it's a little silly) if the ST wanted to allow it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T12:59:08-07:00","id":508345,"title":"","content":"I would generally treat a professional occultist as someone with useful info on the supernatural, rather than someone who has a talent for using it. So, in <i>Buffy</i> terms, early Giles more than the Ripper we saw later. But if you parse it as a profession that helps with magic or rituals or what have you, then you could use it with the psychic Merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-08T19:09:59-07:00","id":508630,"title":"","content":"Thanks everyone! Quite helpful. I appreciate the quick responses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}